& + \rho_{K-m+2}\left(\prod_{j=3}^{m}V_{K-(m-j)}\right)^Ts_{K-m+2}s^T_{K-m+2}\left(\prod_{j=3}^{m}V_{K-(m-j)}\right)\notag\\
& + \ldots\notag\\
& +\rho_{K-1}V^T_{K}s_{K-1}s_{K-1}^TV_{K}\notag\\
&+\rho_{K}s_{K}s_{K}^T.\notag
